  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="26[b]">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Abt">Abt</ref> 26[b]</head>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="ang" source="#liebermann" n="26[b]" corresp="#wit-h">gif þane oþerne ofslæhð, LX scillingum forgelde;</ab>
        <ab type="editionText" xml:lang="ang" source="#oliver" n="27.1" corresp="#wit-h">Gif þane oþerne ofslæhð, LX scillingum forgelde.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#oliver" corresp="#wit-h">If he kills [one of] that second [rank], let him pay with 60 shillings.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#attenborough" corresp="#wit-h">if he slays one of the second class, he shall pay 60 shillings;</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="de" source="#liebermann">wenn er den [an Rang] zweiten erschlägt, entgelte er mit 60 Schillingen;</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#claude" ana="#fromGerman">if he slays the second [in rank], let him pay 60 shillings;</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
